From e32061647a024c6a283f166e7132206bec5ed8e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Z User <z@container>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 14:49:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): prevent closing usuarios modal mid-save
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Both the create/edit user modal and the force-password-reset modal use the
Modal default `dismissible=true`, so a user can click the backdrop or press
Esc while a guardar()/confirmarForzar() request is in flight. The modal
closes, `guardando` stays true forever (the finally{} still runs but the UI
is gone), and on the next open the form may show stale state because the
$effect that resets it on `open` sees open=true again only after the user
manually re-opens.

Pass `dismissible={!guardando}` / `!forcando` so the modal stays put until
the backend responds — same pattern already used in ClienteFormModal and
ConfirmDialog.
---
 src/routes/usuarios/+page.svelte | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/routes/usuarios/+page.svelte b/src/routes/usuarios/+page.svelte
index 0179150..fdff128 100644
--- a/src/routes/usuarios/+page.svelte
+++ b/src/routes/usuarios/+page.svelte
@@ -530,6 +530,7 @@
 		: 'Crea una cuenta con contraseña inicial y rol.'}
 	onClose={() => (modalOpen = false)}
 	width="max-w-xl"
+	dismissible={!guardando}
 >
 	{#snippet children()}
 		{#if formError}
@@ -701,6 +702,7 @@
 	subtitle="El usuario deberá cambiar esta contraseña en su próximo ingreso."
 	onClose={() => (forzarUsuario = null)}
 	width="max-w-md"
+	dismissible={!forcando}
 >
 	{#snippet children()}
 		{#if forzarError}
-- 
